#subtitle: Setting the party's ideological direction.

= Questions of Ideology

The DDP is torn between many different ideological currents. What should be our primary ideological guidance for now?

[? if ideology != 0 : We have previously chosen a [+ ideology +] ideology. Changing it will likely have drawbacks. ?]

- @sammlung_choice: The party's survival depends on holding the coalition together. Ideological consistency must give way to institutional pragmatism.
- @linksliberale_choice: Following Friedrich Naumann, we should pursue Wirtschaftsdemokratie, social reform through mutual recognition between labor and capital.
- @pazifisten_choice: We must defend the Republic and its principles, while keeping true to our roots.
- @wirtschaftsflugel_choice: Fiscal discipline and closer ties to industry and the propertied middle class are the surest path to relevance.
- @easy_discard

@sammlung_choice
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "sammlung") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "sammlung"; sammlung_strength += 10; sammlung_dissent -= 10; linksliberale_dissent -= 5; z_relation += 3; dvp_relation += 3; spd_relation += 2

The Sammlung wing, led by figures like Koch-Weser, argues that a party our size survives only by making itself indispensable to every possible coalition.

@linksliberale_choice
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "linksliberale") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "linksliberale"; linksliberale_strength += 10; linksliberale_dissent -= 10; sammlung_dissent -= 5; spd_relation += 5; democratization += 1; public_trust += 2

The party's Naumann-tradition liberals hold that our purpose is social reform through cooperation between labor and capital, not mere survival - and that this is what should draw us closer to the SPD.

@pazifisten_choice
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "pazifisten") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "pazifisten"; pazifisten_strength += 10; pazifisten_dissent -= 10; linksliberale_dissent -= 5; dvp_relation -= 5; reichswehr_loyalty -= 0.02; public_trust += 3

The party's pacifist and internationalist wing, following Quidde, insists that we must defend the republic but stay unmoored in our principles.

@wirtschaftsflugel_choice
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.ideology && Q.ideology != "wirtschaftsflugel") {
    Q.changed = 1;
}
!}
go-to: changed if changed = 1
on-departure: ideology = "wirtschaftsflugel"; wirtschaftsflugel_strength += 10; wirtschaftsflugel_dissent -= 10; sammlung_dissent -= 5; dvp_relation += 5; z_relation += 2; resources += 1

The party's business-liberal wing, represented by figures like Dietrich, argues that fiscal credibility and closer ties to industry are what will keep the party solvent and relevant, whatever purists in other wings may say.

@changed
on-arrival: sammlung_dissent += 5; linksliberale_dissent += 5; pazifisten_dissent += 5; wirtschaftsflugel_dissent += 5
We have changed ideologies. Many in the party feel unmoored.
